Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.31,0:00:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我被魔鬼本人折磨过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been tortured by the Devil himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.25,0:00:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能把我怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.89,0:00:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.66,0:00:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是英国的记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's British Men of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是一队的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't we supposed to be on the same team?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道人是可以疼死的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know it's possible to die from pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别碰我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from my boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-妈妈  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom? - ‭Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? A hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.59,0:00:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你原来很厉害  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were good at this, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.91,0:00:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猎人  不管多厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters... no matter how good they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最终结果都是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they all end up the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.73,0:00:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从来不希望你和萨姆过这样的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never wanted this for you and Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子的灵质从耳朵流出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the kid had ectoplasm leaking out his ear?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.17,0:00:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是鬼魂附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gotta be ghost possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.61,0:00:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们够生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get angry enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就能控制一个人的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}they can take control of a person's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.41,0:00:38.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯  我们在一起  可以治好你姐姐温蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince, together, we can heal your sister Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.45,0:00:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得把路西法关回笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta put Lucifer back in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.52,0:00:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你是唯一做得到的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only one that can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说过人死而复生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard of people coming back from the dead before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但自己活过来  还隔了30年\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to actually do it, after 30 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.87,0:00:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有好多空白要填补\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have a lot of blanks to fill in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.71,0:00:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对于我  你在这儿就填补了最大的空白\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me, having you here fills in the biggest blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.50,0:01:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.25,0:01:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(莱吉纳)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"没花样了"  开什么玩笑  那地方多棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Played out." You're kidding. That place was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.55,0:01:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.84,0:01:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又是鳄梨吐司  得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another avocado toast? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.57,0:01:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但鳄梨吐司加鹌鹑蛋  真是天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but avocado toast with quail egg? Genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.45,0:01:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要给他们几颗星\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many stars you giving 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.32,0:01:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-两颗  -四颗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two. - Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.88,0:01:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我们的打分会彼此抵消吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize our ratings are just gonna cancel each other out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.18,0:01:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(国会大厦高地  医疗艺术中心  即将开幕)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当初有机会真该买下这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should've bought here when we had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新餐馆  新商店\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, new restos, new stores --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.82,0:01:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,价格也变了  这一带都被\N{\fnArial\fs30}New prices. Neighborhood's been picked clean
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.26,0:01:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,翻修的和公寓开发商捡干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}by flippers and condo developers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.73,0:01:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.92,0:01:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  从那边房子里传来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it came from that house over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.89,0:01:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但谁会住在那里啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but who'd want to live in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.98,0:01:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-蹭房的  或者瘾君子  -还带着婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Squatters or crackheads? - With a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.58,0:01:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-报警  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call 9-1-1. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.14,0:01:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-快点  -好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do it! - Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.27,0:01:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,911  请问您有什么紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}9-1-1, what's your emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.66,0:01:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一座废弃楼房里有个婴儿在哭闹  位置是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, there's a baby in distress in an abandoned house at...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.76,0:02:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.12,0:02:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.13,0:03:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.61,0:03:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么碰了我的胳膊  好像是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something touched my arm. I mean, it's something --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.35,0:03:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我们得赶紧离开  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to get out of here now. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第12季第3集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.64,0:03:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥  你怎么醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.75,0:03:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我总醒着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm always up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天使不需要睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels don't need sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.12,0:04:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望我有你这毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish I had that problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.31,0:04:08.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.22,0:04:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我再去试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll go try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.59,0:04:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝我好运吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish me luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.31,0:04:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.10,0:04:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你离开天堂后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you left heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么时候开始觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}when did it start to feel like...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.31,0:04:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你融入这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you fit, like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.07,0:04:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,属于这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}belonged here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还不确定我有这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm still not sure I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.15,0:04:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.54,0:04:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是属于这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do belong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.21,0:04:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚安  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.84,0:05:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  你查到女王秘密混蛋团的什么资料了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so what have you found on Her Majesty's Secret Suckbags?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把地堡翻了个底朝天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I may have turned the bunker upside down
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.38,0:05:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想找到任何提到\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for any reference whatsoever
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,英国记录者的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the British Men of Letters,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.49,0:05:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all I found
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这封塞在一本老账簿里的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}was this letter tucked into an old ledger,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.68,0:05:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从"伦敦分会"寄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the "London Chapterhouse."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这算是个发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, that's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.04,0:05:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:47.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.85,0:05:56.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早啊  帅哥  来点咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, sunshine. Some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.25,0:05:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不了  谢谢  我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you. I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-小卡  -小卡  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cass? - Cass, wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.27,0:06:05.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,俄亥俄州  克利夫兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cleveland, Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.91,0:06:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可能有路西法的线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I may have a lead on Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我找到一份克利夫兰的警方报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a police report in Cleveland
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说一名男子眼发红光\N{\fnArial\fs30}about a man whose eyes flared a glowing red.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.94,0:06:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能是路西法的新皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be Lucifer in a new body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.36,0:06:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  听上去有门\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Yeah, that sounds like something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.99,0:06:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我们该去看看  -不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should check it out. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼是因为我才被放出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Devil is free because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到他就是我的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finding him is my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  你会需要支援的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you're gonna want some backup on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.17,0:06:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是他  我再打给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it is him, I will call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.52,0:06:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在  我觉得这里需要你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime, I think you're needed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.01,0:06:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.05,0:06:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢  妈妈好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? Mom's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.54,0:06:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我昨晚听到她整夜在地堡里走动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. I heard her walking around all night last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得她有点...不爱说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, don't we think she seems a bit...withdrawn?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,受了惊吓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, shaky?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.97,0:06:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是当然的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course she's shaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.65,0:06:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她上次行走人间时\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hasn't been on this planet since
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.21,0:06:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简·方达还穿着护腿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane Fonda was wearing leg warmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.09,0:07:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她就是需要休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, all she needs is a little R&R.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟家人共处\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, some good family time...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她就会好起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}she'll be aces.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.93,0:07:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.39,0:07:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以再炸点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we can fry some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,估计已经凉了  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's -- that's probably cold by now, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可是熏肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对是你亲生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are so related.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.31,0:07:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你剪头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you cut your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.22,0:07:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果要出去猎魔  还是剪短点好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna keep it short if I'm gonna go out on a hunt, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.51,0:07:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干吗留着长发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why give the bad guys the advantage
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让坏人可以拉扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}of long, pullable hair, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这话我跟萨姆说了好多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been trying to tell Sam that for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说  "出去猎魔"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you say, uh, "going out on a hunt"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.53,0:07:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发现了个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.47,0:07:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were still struggling
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摸索互联网这种物呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}with even the idea of the Internet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩进镇时  我让他买了几份报纸回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had Dean pick up some newspapers when he went into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.85,0:07:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.71,0:07:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可没说你是想找案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell me you were looking for a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.54,0:07:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.37,0:07:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...found one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.04,0:07:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明尼苏达州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minnesota.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.42,0:08:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两人死亡  房间紧锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two dead, locked room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.65,0:08:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被害人报警说听到婴儿哭声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victims had put in a call about a crying baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.79,0:08:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那里是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the place was empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.23,0:08:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现场只有他们的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing at the scene was their bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.83,0:08:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经五天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been five days,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.40,0:08:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,验尸官尚未给出死亡原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the coroner still hasn't put out a cause of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.80,0:08:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,似乎有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seemed fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.25,0:08:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能不是案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.74,0:08:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是想...出去转转\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought I might... get out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.32,0:08:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,活动筋骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}stretch my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你根本不想去猎魔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I thought you weren't down to hunt in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.49,0:08:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世事多变嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, things change, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.27,0:08:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,家族猎魔之旅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family hunting trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.91,0:08:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  10分钟后车里见\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Meet at the car in 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.91,0:08:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是要"休息一下"吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the R&R?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.81,0:08:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这...\N{\fnArial\fs30}W--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.55,0:08:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡已经治好了你被烤的脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, Cass healed your s'mores foot, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝车也被我修复如初  我们可以上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got Baby back to mint. We're road ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.25,0:08:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果妈妈想猎魔  我们就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if Mom wants to hunt, I say we hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.59,0:09:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好摩托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.51,0:09:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你走之后  这世上好多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot of things that have gone to seed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.61,0:09:29.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都大不如前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}since you were here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.45,0:09:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但其中不包括零食的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the variety in snack food flavors
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.50,0:09:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多变风味\N{\fnArial\fs30}is not one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.88,0:09:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,牛肉干  照烧的  拉差辣椒酱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got your teriyaki jerky, we got your sriracha,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,辣青柠的  这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we got your chili lime, which...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.96,0:09:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}is my personal favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试试辣青柠的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's give chili lime a whirl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.77,0:09:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's...good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.95,0:09:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artificial,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.85,0:09:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点刺舌头\N{\fnArial\fs30}kinda tingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.55,0:10:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才叫好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how you know it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.82,0:10:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.78,0:10:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我见识过文斯的各种样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I been around all stripes of Vince, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.32,0:10:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,醉酒的文斯  抑郁的文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drunk Vince, depressed Vince,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.85,0:10:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,夸大狂的"我是金上帝"的文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}megalomaniacal "I'm a Golden God" Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但把我从门里丢出去的文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Vince who threw me through that door...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}that wasn't him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.37,0:10:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且不仅是因为他的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it wasn't just his eyes, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.90,0:10:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的力气  他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I mean, the strength. He was like --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.73,0:10:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像个综合格斗摔跤手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was like an MMA fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.78,0:10:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像20岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, he was like 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.49,0:10:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你有他的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hear from him,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.49,0:10:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定给我来电\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't hesitate to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.71,0:10:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的...碧昂斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Agent...Beyoncé?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:08.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我就是杰斯探员了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that makes me Agent Jay Z.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雪莉·帕特里奇探员  明尼阿波利斯办事处的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Shirley Partridge, out of the Minneapolis field office.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.03,0:11:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是我的搭档  卡西迪和伯纳杜奇探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are my partners, Agent Cassidy and Agent Bonaduce.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个本地案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a local case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.63,0:11:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-联调局为什么会感兴趣...  -他们是新人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why would the FBI be interest-- - They're new.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.18,0:11:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第一次办案想有人指点着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanted their first case to have training wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.73,0:11:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想看看尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanted to have a look at the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.01,0:11:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你尚未提交报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you haven't filed a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.01,0:11:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确认死因出现什么问题了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has there been any problem determining the cause of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.14,0:11:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问题  不不  我查明死因了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem? No. No, no, no. I figured out the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.64,0:11:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是根本不合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just doesn't make any damn sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.65,0:11:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是烧伤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a burn?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.71,0:11:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冻伤  是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frostbite. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.11,0:11:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两名被害人都死于急性低温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both victims died of acute hypothermia...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.35,0:11:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在一间18度的房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a 65-degree room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.18,0:11:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我解剖时  他们的心脏都...\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I opened them up, their hearts were literally --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:11:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真真正正的  冻住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I mean literally -- frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要怎么把这个告诉公众\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna tell me how to present that to the public?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.15,0:12:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有他们的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or to their families?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.49,0:12:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还指点他们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much for training wheels, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,偶然相遇  查同一条线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bumping into each other, working the same leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.60,0:12:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多巧啊  小卡君\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the odds, Cassie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.97,0:12:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是命运让我们相遇的  -我不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fate brought us together. - I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.22,0:12:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们组团对付阿玛拉时不挺厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made a somewhat effective team against Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been months, I mean months,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.56,0:12:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有试图杀死彼此了\N{\fnArial\fs30}since we last tried to kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.43,0:12:24.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都有很强烈的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both got very, very good reasons
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.68,0:12:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望路西法死\N{\fnArial\fs30}to want Lucifer dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.41,0:12:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.18,0:12:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟文斯的二把手交谈时\N{\fnArial\fs30}...while you were gabbing with Vince's second fiddle,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.84,0:12:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去翻了他的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was ransacking his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.05,0:12:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发现了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found these.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.25,0:12:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他亲爱的姐姐温蒂寄来的明信片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Postcards from his beloved sister Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.96,0:12:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊  地址什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, lookie here. An address and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.17,0:12:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,值得一看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worth a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.98,0:13:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定那玩意你会用了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you got the swing of that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第三次回答你  会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the third time, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.91,0:13:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  这不是数码的  我能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's analog. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.43,0:13:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.26,0:14:27.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  这里有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, we got something over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.58,0:14:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam? - ‭Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.78,0:14:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.29,0:14:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.34,0:14:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-妈妈  -萨姆  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom. - ‭Sam! Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.18,0:14:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撑住  妈妈  我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, Mom! We're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  离门远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, get away from the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.28,0:15:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.55,0:15:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  你受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, you're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走  快走  出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.54,0:15:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.17,0:15:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以出去了吗  去挨家敲门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to head out? Go knock on some doors?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-敲门  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doors? - ‭Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.70,0:15:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找邻居问问  去记录厅查查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to the neighbors, hit up the Hall of Records,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.39,0:15:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,研究案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}work the...case?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.95,0:15:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我们还那么做吧  -有时候吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We still do that, right? - Sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  有了互联网  大部分的跑腿工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the, uh, the Internet has made a lot of that legwork...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.66,0:15:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都不必要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obsolete.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.07,0:15:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经进入了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm already in
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.72,0:15:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣保罗的警局数据库\N{\fnArial\fs30}the St. Paul Police Department database.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.73,0:15:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-有发现吗  -嗯  很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything? - ‭Yeah, a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.82,0:16:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查到很多警方报告  有2004年的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got police reports filed from 2004...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.76,0:16:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有91  89  85  78的\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, '91, '89, '85, '78.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.28,0:16:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(本地女孩死于肇事逃逸)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是死亡  都是孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All deaths. All kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.84,0:16:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.12,0:16:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来一切都始于这个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like it started with this girl here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.37,0:16:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白·莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth Moriarty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.32,0:16:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你用那个查到了那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got all of that from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.81,0:16:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会教你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll teach you how to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.97,0:16:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是碧昂斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Agent Beyoncé,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.22,0:17:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is my, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.19,0:17:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搭档  斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}my partner, Agent Zee.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.41,0:17:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想问你几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, we wanted to ask you a few questions
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于你弟...\N{\fnArial\fs30}about your bro...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.57,0:17:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}...ther.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.62,0:17:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得萨姆和迪恩也会遇到这种事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think that happens to Sam and Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.63,0:17:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,经常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.06,0:17:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文尼  打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vinny, please call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.87,0:17:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有两个联邦探员来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got two federal agents asking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.60,0:17:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道你昨天是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know what was with you yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.40,0:17:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你惹麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.51,0:17:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说对了  温蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}How right you are, Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.80,0:17:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯来过这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨天来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.77,0:17:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.92,0:17:46.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她最近被人治愈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been recently healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.62,0:17:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.83,0:17:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜猜  你弟弟让你重新站了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess -- your brother got you up and walking again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.42,0:17:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还喜欢你的双腿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how are you enjoying the use of those legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.29,0:18:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他给你的礼物  我可以拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the gift he gave you, I can take away like --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.92,0:18:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,治好你的那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing that healed you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.56,0:18:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}that wasn't your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.22,0:18:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是别的东西  古老而邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something...something else, something old and evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.73,0:18:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你内心其实是知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...I think a part of you knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.22,0:18:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不想伤害文斯  我们想帮助他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want to hurt Vince. We wanna help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.72,0:18:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他突然跑来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He showed up out of the blue
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.03,0:18:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像奇迹一般治好了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he fixed me like a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.76,0:18:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他很冷漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he did it cold, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.10,0:18:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,仿佛这对他毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was nothing to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.96,0:18:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就好像在跑个腿  都没怎么说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like he was running an errand. Barely said a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他跟他的粉丝朋友走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then he just took off with his groupie friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.28,0:18:48.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么粉丝朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}His groupie friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.70,0:18:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,红发女人  没怎么说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red-headed broad. Didn't say much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.57,0:18:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,文斯在酋长山的小屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Vince's cabin in Sagamore Hills...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.39,0:19:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据说他最棒的专辑都是在那里写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, all of his greatest records were written there --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,, 《蛇纹石》《仁慈剧院》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Serpentine", "Theater of Mercy"...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.70,0:19:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我早该知道你有事瞒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've known there was something you weren't telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.58,0:19:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.57,0:19:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和妈妈不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}So mother and I had an unfortunate,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.72,0:19:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也尴尬地遭遇了路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}if not rather embarrassing, run-in with Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你生气是因为你是我"寻找路西法小队"的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just mad because you're only my second choice
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.34,0:19:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第二选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a Lucifer-hunt team-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.16,0:19:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  其实  我觉得这挺温馨\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, actually, I think it's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.11,0:19:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你是受野心和复仇的驱使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought your motivation was ambition and revenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.15,0:19:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在我知道你只是想救妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}but now I know you just wanna save your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.98,0:19:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才不是为了救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about saving her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.05,0:19:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法带着一个法力强大的女巫跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer has made off with a colossally powerful witch
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.12,0:19:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  此人还是世间唯一\N{\fnArial\fs30}who, by the way, is the only person alive
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.62,0:19:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能把他关回笼子的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can slam him back in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他要么会杀了她  控制她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will either kill her, control her,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.73,0:19:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者她会提出效力于最大的坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}or she will offer her services to the biggest bad in the town
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.75,0:19:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以求自保  就像她以往那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}in order to save her neck, like she always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.35,0:19:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这些听上去是好结果吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do any of those sound like particularly good outcomes to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那个女巫脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got any beauty spells locked up
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.83,0:20:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,装了什么美容咒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that witchy brain of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.51,0:20:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为这个皮囊能撑久点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought this one would last a bit longer
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.04,0:20:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会像基斯·理查兹老得那么快\N{\fnArial\fs30}before going all Keith Richards on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.74,0:20:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么跳皮囊我都腻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This vessel hopping's getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.53,0:20:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚习惯了一具肉身的限制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as I get used to the limitations of one meatsack,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.92,0:20:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就得弃船  再跳进另一具不完美的身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta cut bait and jump to the next flawed lump.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.49,0:20:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是要我把这具皮囊弄成永久性的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you want me to make this vessel permanent?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.11,0:20:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,足够强大  能支撑住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong enough to hold you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.32,0:20:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是挺合适我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does look good on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.88,0:20:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿出本事来吧  小红\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me what you got, Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.54,0:20:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I'd help, I would,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.54,0:20:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但《诅咒之书》不在我手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't have the Book of the Damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.25,0:20:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我弄丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.25,0:20:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很清楚你把它放哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know damned well where you put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白我的梗了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see what I did there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.80,0:20:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"诅咒"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Damned."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:21:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说  你才不需要那本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, you don't need the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.67,0:21:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这么聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clever girl like you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.50,0:21:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定早都记住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}must have it all up here by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.30,0:21:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我拒绝呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就再次扭断你的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I snap your neck again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.30,0:21:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会直接把你的脑袋扭下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll rip your head clean off afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.34,0:21:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-童鬼  -对  来自斯堪的纳维亚传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mylings? - Yeah, from Scandinavian lore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.21,0:21:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是儿童的鬼魂  复仇鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, children's spirits, vengeful ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.13,0:21:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"他们的哭声将大人引向死亡"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Their cries to help lure adults to their death."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.53,0:21:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,提到冰冻心脏了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything about frozen hearts?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.46,0:21:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, not yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.64,0:21:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这是古老  不完整的民间传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is just from old, incomplete folk accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.95,0:21:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都知道传说并不是完全准确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all know the lore isn't always 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.53,0:21:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许吧  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道  那个抓住了我的小男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is, that little boy who grabbed me, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.40,0:21:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他并不想伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't wanna hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.25,0:21:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.27,0:22:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.40,0:22:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定是那种感觉  但  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}it must've felt that way, but, Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.74,0:22:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被害人都是被婴儿哭声引去致死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the victims were all lured to their death by a baby's cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.68,0:22:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔莉亚被杀前  恶灵标记了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spirit marked Natalia right before she was killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.25,0:22:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那恶灵也标记了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}the same way the spirit marked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.56,0:22:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不是我们及时赶了进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if we hadn't gotten there in time...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.24,0:22:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道所有孩子的名字  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look, we know all the kids' names, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.07,0:22:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道他们都葬在本地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know that they're all buried locally,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.19,0:22:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去撒盐烧骨吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I say we salt and burn 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.09,0:22:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个稳妥的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the safe bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.58,0:22:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.36,0:22:29.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, let's do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.14,0:22:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.32,0:22:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.04,0:22:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.76,0:22:41.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你没事吧  -妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, you okay? - ‭Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.99,0:22:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.63,0:22:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.45,0:22:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.81,0:22:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许  你该留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}May-- maybe, uh, you should stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.67,0:22:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.31,0:23:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-有事打给我们  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call if you need us. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.93,0:23:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.40,0:23:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back soon. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.09,0:23:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉姆齐县地契登记簿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey County Register of Deeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.75,0:23:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  我需要张伯伦街1781号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, I'm looking for contact information
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.82,0:23:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后一位屋主的联系方式  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the last owner of 1781 Chamberlin Street, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.09,0:23:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你不能像其他人那样查网站吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, can't you just use the website like everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.40,0:23:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.86,0:23:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.43,0:23:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.48,0:23:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.40,0:23:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他那么冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}was so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.73,0:23:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是不明白是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still don't understand what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.18,0:24:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发现他前一分钟才看过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked on him just a minute before I found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.59,0:24:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么会那么快就凉了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd he get so cold so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.93,0:24:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  抱歉我这么说个不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gosh, sorry for going on like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.16,0:24:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不必道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.59,0:24:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卢卡斯什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did Lucas look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.63,0:24:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他好可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he was so handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.38,0:24:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,金发  蓝眼睛如水晶一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blond hair and these crystal blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.84,0:24:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有别的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.98,0:24:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他脸颊上有伤疤\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a scar on his cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.23,0:24:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,邻居的狗弄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the neighbors' dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.57,0:24:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  谢莉尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Cheryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.10,0:24:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉又提起这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for dredging all this up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.59,0:24:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.19,0:24:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实  也挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it's kinda nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.19,0:24:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在都没人打电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one talks on the phone anymore, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.98,0:24:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.42,0:24:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再次感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.53,0:25:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(卢卡斯·凯林格)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.97,0:25:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是可怕的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grim work.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.52,0:25:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.01,0:25:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我担心妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm worried about Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.32,0:25:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.01,0:25:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.94,0:25:24.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.69,0:25:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的确  她还在摸索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, yeah, she's still working out the kinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.99,0:25:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all still working out the kinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.31,0:25:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  我们不能就这一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, I mean, can't we, for once,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.37,0:25:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不把什么事都变成个麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}just not turn everything into a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.63,0:25:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能就这一次拥有件美好的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, can we, for once, just have one good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.34,0:25:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-妈妈不是一件"东西"  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom's not a thing. - ‭Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.87,0:25:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我也很开心  我开心坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm happy, too, Dean. I am. I'm overjoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.08,0:25:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但  她有些不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...there's something about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.12,0:25:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, something's going on with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.72,0:25:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  她在适应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she's adjusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.95,0:25:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  她在挣扎\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's struggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.16,0:25:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她想靠埋头猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she's trying to bury herself in hunting
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.74,0:25:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来避免面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}to avoid dealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.25,0:25:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你怎么知道  -多年的个人经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And how do you know that? - Years of personal experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.82,0:25:58.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.05,0:26:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有其母必有其子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like mother, like sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.67,0:26:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.52,0:26:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,武器袋不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons bag is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.40,0:27:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.84,0:27:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是叫这个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your name, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.89,0:27:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你妈妈谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I talked to your mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.62,0:27:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她好想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She misses you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.58,0:28:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卢卡斯  你为什么带我来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas, why did you bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.54,0:28:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help...us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.58,0:28:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-喂  -妈妈  你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Mom, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.45,0:28:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在张伯伦街的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm at the Chamberlin house,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.22,0:28:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查证我的一个预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.21,0:28:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们把骸骨都撒盐烧毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we salted and burned all the remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.68,0:29:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那可没起效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.72,0:29:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从房子里出来  等着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, get out of the house and wait for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.13,0:29:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  喂  -妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? Hello? - ‭Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.24,0:29:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.74,0:29:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.59,0:29:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.33,0:29:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山楂树的灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ash of the Hawthorn Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.43,0:29:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,图案呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pattern?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.78,0:29:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,督伊德教的字符\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Druidic glyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.39,0:29:22.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我用的是我自己发明的混合咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm using a hybrid spell of my own devise --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.86,0:29:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,, 《诅咒之书》加凯尔特魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Book of the Damned and Celtic magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.39,0:29:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该能让你的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should give your vessel
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.28,0:29:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拥有最强大的树的恢复力和强度\N{\fnArial\fs30}the resiliency and strength of the mightiest tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.52,0:29:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,按说可以开个黄色笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a woody joke in there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.01,0:29:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们说说那个讨厌的词  "应该能"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get back to that nagging little word -- "should."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.77,0:29:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种事没人尝试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's uncharted territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.40,0:29:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能保证咒语会永远有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I can't promise the spell with last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.64,0:29:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有已知的这样的魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no known magic for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.78,0:29:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但它撑得住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it will last.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.98,0:30:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}The final step.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.38,0:30:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以说话吗  黑暗魔王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Permission to speak, Dark Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.22,0:30:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果...等咒语成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}If -- when the spell succeeds
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.97,0:30:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也恢复了全部力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you are restored to your full glory...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.11,0:30:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会杀了你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will I just kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.66,0:30:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了咒语  我还有其他价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can be of value beyond this spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.70,0:30:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.91,0:30:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, my Liege.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.97,0:31:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.34,0:31:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小红  你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.64,0:31:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加速了腐败  陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sped up the decaying process, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.60,0:31:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为{\u1}基斯·理查兹{\u0}(摇滚乐手)算够糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought Keith Richards was bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.60,0:31:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.75,0:31:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试试{\u1}伊基·波普{\u0}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try Iggy Pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.03,0:31:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,砍头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decapitation is...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.66,0:31:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都太便宜你了  红发贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}far too merciful for you, Ginger Bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.11,0:31:24.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.34,0:31:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你休想毁掉我  -现在还不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't destroy me! - ‭Not yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.16,0:31:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我可以送你去很远的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can send you far, far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.12,0:31:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去海底找新皮囊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try finding a new vessel at the bottom of the bloody ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.75,0:31:37.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.44,0:31:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么把你困在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's keeping you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.93,0:31:46.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.86,0:32:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是那小女孩的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the father of that little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.44,0:32:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了他们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.85,0:32:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有那些孩子...\N{\fnArial\fs30}all those ch--
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.01,0:32:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.42,0:32:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.32,0:32:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.67,0:32:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.34,0:33:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}My house. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.75,0:33:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My children.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.02,0:33:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永远是\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.27,0:33:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.25,0:33:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以抵抗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can fight this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.12,0:33:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.84,0:33:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.54,0:33:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}The basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.33,0:33:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.37,0:34:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-妈妈  -妈妈不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom? -‭ Mommy's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.82,0:34:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别  别逼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't. Don't make me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.34,0:34:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有我呢  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.99,0:36:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们找路西法  他刚走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}If you're looking for Lucifer, you just missed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.48,0:36:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喝杯茶吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cup of tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.58,0:36:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到你逼我重新入局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until you forced me to get back in the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.32,0:36:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还想忘记路西法来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd tried to forget about Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.72,0:36:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loathe him,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.67,0:36:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌自己参与了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I loathe that I had any part
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.05,0:36:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他从他该待的坑里放出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}in letting him out of the pit he belongs in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.30,0:36:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你会帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you'll help us, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.47,0:36:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  别做梦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good God, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.30,0:36:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,联调局西装的打扮\N{\fnArial\fs30}That whole FBI pantsuit look?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.79,0:36:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my hex bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.01,0:36:55.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你们困住了路西法  需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you get Lucifer cornered and find yourself in need,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.32,0:36:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.85,0:37:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要洗个澡吗  睡一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you gonna take a shower? Take a nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.94,0:37:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天累坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really went through it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.36,0:37:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.79,0:37:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.33,0:37:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  如果我和萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}listen, apologies if, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.45,0:37:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抢了你的活儿或排挤你了  那对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}me and Sam hijacked or sidelined you in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.76,0:37:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this was your case, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.02,0:37:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你干得漂亮  又一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...well, you kicked ass. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.27,0:37:25.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kicked ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.45,0:37:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你救了我  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved me. I --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.64,0:37:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.39,0:37:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些孩子是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, those kids were innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.54,0:37:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都不知道莫里亚蒂是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hell, we didn't even know what Moriarty's deal was.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.83,0:37:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.65,0:37:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他附身我时  我看到...\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he possessed me, I saw...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.80,0:37:47.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.20,0:37:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.70,0:37:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雨果失去孩子后  他疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Hugo lost his child, he went mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.51,0:38:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将自己活埋在了地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buried himself alive in his basement
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.94,0:38:03.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把自己砌在了墙里  活活饿死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and walled himself in and starved to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.06,0:38:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.61,0:38:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但当新家庭搬了进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when new families moved in,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.76,0:38:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带孩子的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}families with children,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.53,0:38:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他觊觎那些孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}he coveted those children.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.81,0:38:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是便夺走了他们  杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he took them. Killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.38,0:38:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知怎么将他们的灵魂跟自己的鬼魂连在了一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And somehow that bound their spirits to his.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.08,0:38:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就是这样得到了魔力\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's where he got his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.33,0:38:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是那么...贪心\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was so...greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.13,0:38:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,扭曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.02,0:38:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  没事了  你回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, it's okay. All right? You're home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.59,0:38:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.39,0:38:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.15,0:38:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss John.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.08,0:39:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss my boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.20,0:39:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're right here, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.70,0:39:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. In my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.40,0:39:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我还在哀悼我所认识的他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm still mourning them as I knew them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.47,0:39:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的新生儿萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}My baby Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.64,0:39:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的小豆子迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}My little boy Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.69,0:39:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,仿佛昨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just feels like yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.07,0:39:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还一起在天堂  而现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were together in heaven, and now...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.10,0:39:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这儿  约翰没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here, and John is gone
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.23,0:39:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们也没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.73,0:39:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你们在一起的每一刻都提醒着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every moment I spend with you reminds me
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.05,0:39:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能陪伴他们的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}every moment I lost with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.38,0:39:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为如果我猎魔  工作  就能清空思绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought hunting, working, would clear my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.72,0:40:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom... ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.95,0:40:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}w-what are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.95,0:40:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.04,0:40:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.61,0:40:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so...so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.84,0:40:32.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need a little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.32,0:41:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.95,0:41:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you both.

